      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-11-21T16:05:35.549Z",
      "cooked": "<p><em>the change to the Trials!</em> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> No more “Cosmitron plays Bioengineering and then his entire deck”!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\">\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>The Sentinels and Other Weird Issues” is my Dr. Teeth and the Electric Mayhem cover band</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>XD</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>Argo’s “first time this card is dealt damage by a hero target each turn\" happens only once per turn in total.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Uh-huh! See, this is why I’m a stickler for using “any” or “each” and never “a”! &gt;:P</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>If the target for Burn the Wicked has more than 10 HP, Lantern Jack does not deal himself any damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh wow, that card’s wording was <em>not</em> clear in the slightest!</p>\n<p>Fantastic set of clarifications and updates. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
