      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "*the change to the Trials!* :O No more \"Cosmitron plays Bioengineering and then his entire deck\"!\n\n[quote]\n*The Sentinels and Other Weird Issues” is my Dr. Teeth and the Electric Mayhem cover band*\n[/quote]\nXD\n\n[quote]\nArgo’s “first time this card is dealt damage by a hero target each turn\" happens only once per turn in total.\n[/quote]\nUh-huh! See, this is why I'm a stickler for using \"any\" or \"each\" and never \"a\"! >:P\n\n[quote]\nIf the target for Burn the Wicked has more than 10 HP, Lantern Jack does not deal himself any damage.\n[/quote]\nOh wow, that card's wording was *not* clear in the slightest!\n\nFantastic set of clarifications and updates. :D",
